Before sub call:
globalPts(2).x =  20
globalPts(2).y =  200

In sub (global array):
pts(0).x =  0 (expect 0)
pts(1).x =  10 (expect 10)
pts(2).x =  20 (expect 20)
pts(2).y =  200 (expect 200)

After sub call:
globalPts(1).x =  999

=== Now testing with LOCAL array ===
Before sub call:
localPts(2).x =  20

In sub (local array param):
pts(0).x =  0 (expect 0)
pts(1).x =  10 (expect 10)
pts(2).x =  20 (expect 20)
After sub call:
localPts(1).x =  888

